    "before_footer": {
      "title": "Elevating Spaces with Innovation and Style",
      "description": "<p>Simpolo Tiles is synonymous with innovation, quality, and exceptional design, delivering tiles that elevate any space. Crafted with precision, our tiles are renowned for their durability and versatility, making them perfect for both residential and commercial projects. Whether you&rsquo;re transforming a modern living room, revamping a chic kitchen, or adding sophistication to a bathroom, Simpolo&rsquo;s wide collection of floor and wall tiles offers a range of sizes, textures, and colors that suit every style and need. Our designs vary from polished tiles that reflect contemporary luxury to matte finishes that provide subtle elegance, ensuring there&rsquo;s something for every taste. Simpolo Tiles are not only visually appealing but also built to last, combining beauty with functionality. Committed to sustainability, we continue to innovate while ensuring that our tiles are environmentally conscious and durable. With Simpolo&rsquo;s premium collection, you can bring any vision to life, creating timeless, stylish interiors.</p>"
